# Build context is the repository root. The server images build from the Cargo
# workspace (crates/); client/kerbridge-agent-windows/Dockerfile cross-compiles
# the Windows client from client/. Everything else is noise -- and target/ alone
# is gigabytes.
*
!LICENSE
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!deploy/
!client/
# One file from the testbench, for deploy/mockidp/Dockerfile. Narrow on purpose:
# the rest of testbench/ is fixture corpora that `cargo test` reads from the
# source tree, and belongs in no image.
!testbench/mock-idp/
crates/**/target/
client/target/
**/.local-tmp/
deploy/secrets/
deploy/.env
